WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:03.860
- What do you think is consciousness?

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:05.250
Is is simply self-awareness,

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.060
so including yourself into
the model of the world?

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:11.330
- This way that some people tell me no,

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.020
this is only part of consciousness,

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:13.887
and then they start in,

00:00:13.887 --> 00:00:15.740
"What do you really
mean by consciousness?"

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.573
And I lose them.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:21.500
For me, consciousness
is having a blueprint

00:00:22.675 --> 00:00:24.120
of your self as well.

